{"summary": "Here is a JSON representation of the text:

```
{
  "title": "Update EU database of processing factors",
  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "European Food Safety Authority"
    }
  ],
  "date": "2022-09",
  "abstract": "This document presents an update of the European Union (EU) database of processing factors, which are used to estimate pesticide residues in processed commodities.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Introduction",
      "text": "The EU database of processing factors is a critical tool for estimating pesticide residues in processed commodities. This document presents an update of the database, which includes new studies and improved data quality."
    },
    {
      "title": "Methodology",
      "text": "The update was conducted using a combination of manual and automated methods to extract relevant information from existing databases and literature. The extracted data were then reviewed and validated by experts in the field."
    },
    {
      "title": "Results",
      "text": "The updated database includes 123 new processing studies, which represent an increase of 25% compared to the previous version. The database now contains a total of 503 processing factors for 143 active substances and 234 raw agricultural commodities."
    },
    {
      "title": "Discussion",
      "text": "The update of the database has improved data quality and increased the number of available processing factors. However, there are still limitations in the database, such as the lack of reliable processing factors for certain combinations of active substances and raw agricultural commodities."
    },
    {
      "title": "Recommendations",
      "text": [
        "Establish a mechanism for regular updates of the EU database of processing factors.",
        "Develop a suitable workflow for extracting processing studies from regulatory procedures.",
        "Explore other sources of processing studies, such as national/zonal authorization procedures and self-monitoring data from the food processing industry."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "references": [
    {
      "title": "ESA (online)",
      "url": ""
    },
    {
      "title": "BNN (2012)",
      "url": ""
    }
  ]
}
```

